compatible with either of the terms above and governs those files alone.

  src/fonts/montserrat-wght500-site-trimmed.woff2
    Montserrat — Copyright 2011 The Montserrat Project Authors
    https://github.com/JulietaUla/Montserrat

  src/fonts/jetbrainsmono-wght500-mono-spec-no-liga.woff2
    JetBrains Mono — Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
    https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono

Both are Modified Versions under OFL 1.1: instanced to a single weight and
subset to the repertoire this site sets (scripts/dev/subset-fonts.mjs). Neither
upstream family declares a Reserved Font Name, so clause 3 does not apply and
the subsets keep the original family names.

Each file carries the full licence text and licence URL in its own name table
(IDs 13 and 14), which is how clause 2 is satisfied — pyftsubset drops those
records by default, and the build script asserts they survived. The licence is
therefore readable from the shipped binary:

  python -c "from fontTools.ttLib import TTFont; \
    print(str(TTFont('src/fonts/montserrat-wght500-site-trimmed.woff2')['name'] \
    .getName(13,3,1)))"

